# Line-ending policy for the public deploy repository.
#
# GENERATED - this file is copied in as .gitattributes by BUILD-DEPLOY-SET.mjs.
#
# -text means "never convert". The deploy folder is a copy of files that already exist, byte
# for byte, and the public repository should hold exactly those bytes.
#
# Without this, git applies whatever line-ending policy the machine happens to be configured
# with. A file identical to its source then shows as every line changed, so a one-line CSS
# tweak arrives as a 56-line diff and nobody can see what actually changed. Worse, the bytes
# that reach the live site depend on how git felt like checking them out.
* -text
